Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["NetworkArchitecture", "ObjectName",
 CellID->400211579,ExpressionUUID->"eb34bdcf-8626-3b45-873a-337e5b7d6c0d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"2f473599-f5ad-bf4a-9554-0b1ad07599b3"],
 Cell[BoxData[
 "NetworkArchitecture"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7529ca9d-0039-8c4d-9177-4e82ef7ebd50"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["MakeUnet",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/MakeUnet"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"e6cdadbf-99d9-4b45-8add-27899b992205"],
 ". It defines the architecture of the network. It can be \"UNet\", \
\"UNet+\", or \"UNet++\". For \"UNet+\" or \"UNet++\" it can also be {arch, \
i} where i specifies how many of the top layers are connected to the mapping \
layer."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->607809215,ExpressionUUID->"f3943fe8-3f07-a649-937f-7c06f2655ef9"],

